ike centered as it charges toward the lens. At three seconds, a hard cut shifts to a tight left-side profile beside the spinning front wheel while the road streaks horizontally behind it. At six seconds, a hard cut reveals a high overhead view as the rider leans through a sweeping right-hand curve and the long shadow slides across the asphalt. At nine seconds, a forward-facing helmet camera shows only the handlebars, windscreen, and rushing road as the bike accelerates out of the bend. At twelve seconds, a low rear chase angle follows the rear tire and exhaust through heat shimmer and a sharp exhaust crack, then at fifteen seconds a roadside camera pans with the motorcycle as it blasts across the frame. At eighteen seconds, a final high rear aerial view watches the bike race toward the glowing horizon while the engine and wind fade naturally.","English",true,"",false,"12332525"]},{"id":5832,"type":"2d2fc0dd-01bd-478d-812e-42f07e333adc","pos":[-962.7628663501691,5829.72866446571],"size":[350.33342073105405,203.6607754693946],"flags":{},"order":77,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":14643},{"localized_name":"negative","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":14644},{"localized_name":"video_latent","name":"video_latent","type":"LATENT","link":14645},{"localized_name":"audio_latent","name":"audio_latent","type":"LATENT","link":14633},{"name":"noise_seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"noise_seed"},"link":null},{"name":"sampler_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sampler_name"},"link":null},{"name":"sigmas","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"sigmas"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"IMAGE","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[14634]},{"localized_name":"Audio","name":"Audio","type":"AUDIO","links":[14635]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.20.1","proxyWidgetErrorQuarantine":[{"originalEntry":["5424","control_after_generate"],"reason":"missingSubgraphInput","attemptedAtVersion":1}],